{"4125710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Runesica: The Legendary Part-Timer", "steam_appid": 4125710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“If I don’t earn 3,000 gold in 30 days, I’ll be arrested for treason against the crown…!”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong>Al</strong>, the shop boy of the town of <i>Runesica</i>, earn money and change his fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runesica: The Legendary Part-Timer</strong> is a <strong>point-and-click medieval part-time job simulation game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where you manage the protagonist’s daily schedule and try to earn enough gold within <strong>30 days to escape from Runesica.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the daily life of a cozy medieval fantasy village filled with charming visuals and light-hearted stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings <strong>random events</strong> that affect the game’s difficulty and outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>choices</strong> determine how well Al can survive his part-time adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>friendships</strong> with the townspeople, plan <strong>smart daily routines</strong>, and guide Al through his unpredictable days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, open the <strong>diary</strong> to analyze your slot combinations and discover the best strategy for tomorrow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices will change the boy’s destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the most <strong>legendary part-timer</strong> in Runesica and rewrite his fate!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“If I don’t earn 3,000 gold in 30 days, I’ll be arrested for treason against the crown…!”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong>